      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "api-allow example policy",
      "items": [
        "Applies to pods labeled app: api; policyTypes are Ingress and Egress",
        "Allows only inbound traffic from app: frontend pods on TCP 8080",
        "Allows only outbound traffic to app: database pods on TCP 5432"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Selectors and prerequisites",
      "items": [
        "podSelector, namespaceSelector and ipBlock can be combined in from/to",
        "By default all pods can talk to each other; network policies restrict this",
        "Requires a CNI plugin that supports network policies (Calico, Cilium, Antrea)"
      ]
    }
